[save slot=""]
audio music "res://music/03_timeline.ogg"
[background arg="res://backgrounds/heaven_hangout.jpeg" fade="0.0"]
join lucifer (Left) rightmost
join jurema (Right) leftmost
jurema: Lucifer, sweetie, are you feeling any better?
lucifer: I don't think I will ever feel 'better' in this continuum.
jurema (Right Angry): What did Osiris and Vox do to you?
lucifer (Left Angry): Words fail. The English language doesn't have enough vowels for the horror.
leave jurema [animation="Bounce Out"]
join aphrodite (Right Angry) leftmost [animation="Bounce In"]
aphrodite: I just don't get it. Everything was totally fine yesterday!
update lucifer (Left Angry)
lucifer (Left Angry): DO NOT SAY THAT WORD.
aphrodite: What word? Yesterday?
lucifer (Left Angry): 'Yesterday' is a cute mortal fairytale!
lucifer (Left Angry): I spent four hundred quadrillion subjective years in the belly of a supersonic sardine tin!
lucifer: You don't know the agony of watching absolute darkness slowly shift into Prussian blue over nine thousand millennia!
leave aphrodite [animation="Bounce Out"]
join jurema (Right Angry) leftmost [animation="Bounce In"]
jurema: Okay, take a breath. Give us just a second to—
lucifer (Left Angry): A SECOND?!
lucifer (Left Angry): Do you know how many eons fit into a second at light speed?! Don't throw seconds around like pocket change!
lucifer: I need to speak to Suprema right now. Where is she?
jurema: She's locked herself in her bedchamber. She won't see anyone.
lucifer (Left Angry): Why not?!
aphrodite: She fell violently ill.
update lucifer (Pro LG) center [fade="Fade Cross"]
join aphrodite (Left) rightmost [animation="Bounce In"]
aphrodite: I think Horus poisoned her.
aphrodite: He literally joked about having poison prepared for her last week!
jurema: A joke which I personally found completely tasteless.
update lucifer (Pro LG) [animation="Heartbeat" fade="Fade Cross"]
lucifer (Pro Angry LG): Great. The supreme ruler is assassinated, and my eyes are permanently burned with cyan.
leave lucifer
leave jurema
leave aphrodite
audio music -
[background arg="#84efffff" fade="0.5" transition="Simple Fade"]
[wait time="1.0"]
Next day ...
[wait time="1.0"]
jump 04_timeline/
